# The generated notice is compared byte-for-byte by
# `make verify-third-party-notices`, so Git must round-trip it unchanged.
# `-text` also prevents Windows `core.autocrlf` from rewriting embedded licence
# text. This fork stores the package notice under `assets/`, not at the template
# root.
assets/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt -text

# FVM rewrites `.fvmrc` unless it already has FVM's exact key order, LF bytes,
# and no trailing newline. Disable Git EOL conversion so that invariant also
# holds on Windows.
.fvmrc -text
